{"id": "en_car_blizzard_p1", "total": 67.13, "segments": [{"text": "If you get trapped in a blizzard on the highway, do not leave your vehicle behind.", "start": 0.0, "end": 3.3}, {"text": "Mark is stranded on a dark interstate as freezing whiteout conditions rapidly bury the road.", "start": 3.907, "end": 7.76}, {"text": "Subzero darkness surrounds him, and he must stay alive until morning road crews can arrive.", "start": 8.29, "end": 11.86}, {"text": "A violent wall of heavy snow slams into his windshield, killing visibility in every direction.", "start": 12.56, "end": 16.66}, {"text": "He decides to stay inside the car because it provides shelter against the lethal wind.", "start": 17.26, "end": 20.74}, {"text": "A vehicle is far easier for rescue crews to find than a person walking alone.", "start": 21.1, "end": 24.22}, {"text": "One. He steps outside quickly to clear thick snow from the car exhaust pipe first.", "start": 24.8, "end": 28.58}, {"text": "A blocked exhaust pipe can rapidly fill the cabin with deadly, invisible carbon monoxide gas.", "start": 28.58, "end": 32.9}, {"text": "Two. Mark ties a bright cloth to the car door so search teams spot it.", "start": 33.46, "end": 36.544}, {"text": "He also turns on the inside dome light so rescuers can see him through darkness.", "start": 36.94, "end": 39.68}, {"text": "Three. He runs the car engine for about 10 minutes each hour to get heat.", "start": 40.3, "end": 43.62}, {"text": "He cracks a side window open a little to let fresh outside air circulate through.", "start": 44.0, "end": 47.1}, {"text": "He settles into his seat, watching the clock tick down in the dark freezing cabin.", "start": 47.66, "end": 51.1}, {"text": "His signals are glowing bright and the interior warmth keeps him safe from the blizzard.", "start": 51.72, "end": 54.86}, {"text": "It was the perfect survival plan, but Mark suddenly notices a deadly problem forming outside.", "start": 54.86, "end": 59.84}, {"text": "Drifting snow has rapidly piled over the exhaust pipe again while his engine is running.", "start": 60.52, "end": 63.98}], "words": [["If", 0.0, 0.36], ["you", 0.36, 0.5], ["get", 0.5, 0.62], ["trapped", 0.62, 0.82], ["in", 0.82, 1.02], ["a", 1.02, 1.1], ["blizzard", 1.1, 1.32], ["on", 1.32, 1.44], ["the", 1.44, 1.54], ["highway,", 1.54, 1.78], ["do", 2.06, 2.14], ["not", 2.14, 2.4], ["leave", 2.4, 2.66], ["your", 2.66, 2.8], ["vehicle", 2.8, 3.0], ["behind.", 3.0, 3.3], ["Mark", 3.907, 4.143], ["is", 4.143, 4.284], ["stranded", 4.18, 4.48], ["on", 4.48, 4.68], ["a", 4.68, 4.76], ["dark", 4.76, 5.04], ["interstate", 5.04, 5.5], ["as", 5.5, 5.7], ["freezing", 5.7, 6.02], ["whiteout", 6.263, 6.688], ["conditions", 6.4, 6.68], ["rapidly", 6.68, 7.2], ["bury", 7.2, 7.4], ["the", 7.4, 7.6], ["road.", 7.6, 7.76], ["Subzero", 8.29, 8.667], ["darkness", 8.62, 8.94], ["surrounds", 8.94, 9.3], ["him,", 9.3, 9.56], ["and", 9.84, 9.9], ["he", 9.9, 9.96], ["must", 9.96, 10.18], ["stay", 10.18, 10.36], ["alive", 10.36, 10.56], ["until", 10.56, 10.84], ["morning", 10.84, 11.08], ["road", 11.08, 11.3], ["crews", 11.3, 11.48], ["can", 11.48, 11.66], ["arrive.", 11.66, 11.86], ["A", 12.56, 12.68], ["violent", 12.68, 12.96], ["wall", 12.96, 13.16], ["of", 13.16, 13.36], ["heavy", 13.36, 13.46], ["snow", 13.46, 13.66], ["slams", 13.66, 14.14], ["into", 14.14, 14.36], ["his", 14.36, 14.5], ["windshield,", 14.5, 14.8], ["killing", 15.16, 15.34], ["visibility", 15.34, 15.66], ["in", 15.66, 16.0], ["every", 16.0, 16.3], ["direction.", 16.3, 16.66], ["He", 17.26, 17.42], ["decides", 17.42, 17.58], ["to", 17.58, 17.82], ["stay", 17.82, 17.96], ["inside", 17.96, 18.28], ["the", 18.28, 18.52], ["car", 18.52, 18.72], ["because", 18.72, 19.16], ["it", 19.16, 19.24], ["provides", 19.24, 19.46], ["shelter", 19.46, 19.78], ["against", 19.78, 20.08], ["the", 20.08, 20.26], ["lethal", 20.26, 20.46], ["wind.", 20.46, 20.74], ["A", 21.1, 21.16], ["vehicle", 21.16, 21.38], ["is", 21.38, 21.58], ["far", 21.58, 21.84], ["eas